n:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\\" aria-level=\\"1\\"><p dir=\\"ltr\\" style=\\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\\" role=\\"presentation\\"><span style=\\"font-size:9pt;font-family:\'Century Gothic\',sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\\">Meeting with City Veterinary office for additional request for transportation vehicle(Travis), collaboration for stakeholder management, provision of participants and resource persons.</span></p></li><li dir=\\"ltr\\" style=\\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:9pt;font-family:\'Century Gothic\',sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\\" aria-level=\\"1\\"><p dir=\\"ltr\\" style=\\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\\" role=\\"presentation\\"><span style=\\"font-size:9pt;font-family:\'Century Gothic\',sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\\">Meeting with Agricultural Training Institute for list of resource person and possible shouldering of honoraria and other expenses. ATI will also look on shouldering trainings for the intervention phase.</span></p></li><li dir=\\"ltr\\" style=\\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:9pt;font-family:\'Century Gothic\',sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\\" aria-level=\\"1\\"><p dir=\\"ltr\\" style=\\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\\" role=\\"presentation\\"><span style=\\"font-size:9pt;font-family:\'Century Gothic\',sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\\">Meeting with Agronomy Division for setting the final date for the list of participants and the delivery of information to the farmers.</span></p></li><li dir=\\"ltr\\" style=\\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:9pt;font-family:\'Century Gothic\',sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\\" aria-level=\\"1\\"><p dir=\\"ltr\\" style=\\"line-height:1.2;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\\" role=\\"presentation\\"><span style=\\"font-size:9pt;font-family:\'Century Gothic\',sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\\">Virtual Meeting with Mr Junquil for the designs and presentations.</span></p></li></ul>", "office_id": 1, "created_at": "2025-08-07T05:58:03.000000Z", "deleted_at": null, "updated_at": "2025-08-07T05:58:03.000000Z", "ref_division_id": 4, "ref_accomplishment_category_id": 9}}', NULL, '2025-08-07 05:58:03', '2025-08-07 05:58:03'),
